                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ1x_RyCyrQjQRFeMwfE9teds/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURIcWRiV3pRRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "It was my first time at Brun, and it’s so hard to get a reservation! But it was totally worth it—I think it’s now my favorite breakfast spot in Taipei.\n\nThe restaurant is pet-friendly, so I brought my cat along. The waitress was super nice and even greeted our kitty, which was a fun touch.\n\nAll the food tasted amazing, but one thing to note is they don’t offer dish adjustments. For example, we wanted to add more scrambled eggs, but that wasn’t an option.\n\nOverall, I loved the experience and will definitely be back!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "It was my first time at Brun, and it’s so hard to get a reservation! But it was totally worth it—I think it’s now my favorite breakfast spot in Taipei.\n\nThe restaurant is pet-friendly, so I brought my cat along. The waitress was super nice and even greeted our kitty, which was a fun touch.\n\nAll the food tasted amazing, but one thing to note is they don’t offer dish adjustments. For example, we wanted to add more scrambled eggs, but that wasn’t an option.\n\nOverall, I loved the experience and will definitely be back!",
